# Hosting and database

- Production is Vercel at https://www.giftingstore.online (apex too). `*.vercel.app` stays the main CRM site.
- Company portals are `https://{portal_slug}.giftingstore.online` on the **same** Vercel project via the `*.giftingstore.online` wildcard. Set `ROOT_DOMAIN=giftingstore.online`. Do not provision a Hostinger parked domain per slug.
- Hostinger parked-domain API vars (`HOSTINGER_API_TOKEN`, `HOSTINGER_ACCOUNT_USERNAME`, `HOSTINGER_WEBSITE_DOMAIN`, `PORTAL_PARKED_*`) are deprecated for production. `PORTAL_DNS=hostinger` is ignored on Vercel and when `NODE_ENV=production`.
- This app's Supabase project is `ajysowosgjaipczrwpfv` (`corporate-gifting-crm`, ap-south-1) in org `smoddqkpbnbvcqjujvmu`. Ignore `robust-gifting-crm` and `vilms-saas-local-dev` on the same account.
- Never apply SQL to Supabase (no apply_migration/execute_sql) and never ask to; deliver migration + rollback files under `supabase/migrations` and `supabase/rollbacks`.
- Never call the live Hostinger API. Local experiments use `PORTAL_DNS=hostinger` and `HOSTINGER_MOCK=1` only.
